## RelationType: generalizes

Source IRI: `https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/generalizes`. Source definition: relation between two classifiers such that everything classified by the latter is also classified by the former. This BKN projection stores the target entity ID in `generalizes_target_id`.

### Endpoint

| Source | Target | Type |
|--------|--------|------|
| classifier | classifier | direct |

### Mapping Rules

| Source Property | Target Property |
|-----------------|-----------------|
| generalizes_target_id | entity_id |
